<title>NETHERLANDS: SHARES IN AND INT. PUBL RISE ON 96 PROFITS.</title>
<headline>SHARES IN AND INT. PUBL RISE ON 96 PROFITS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in AND International Publishers rose over nine percent, or 1.05 guilders, to 12.00 guilders in early trade on Friday.</p>
<p>Late on Thursday the firm said its 1996 profits were expected to rise by 104 percent to 1.8 million guilders.</p>
<p>AND International Publishers was floated on the Amsterdam stock exchange last December at 3.30 guilders per share.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
